{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>For Your salvation I hope, YHWH.</b> To Dan he was saying thus: Dan, <b>I hope, YHWH</b> that He will save you and exalt you over your enemies. Another interpretation: <b>for Your salvation</b> — that You will act to save Israel, as it is written: ״And he began to save Israel from the hand of the Philistines.״"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:12.366652709Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}